nd Exchange Commission of Pakistan"},"gold":{"available":true,"localName":"سونا","localNameEn":"Gold","note":"Sold mainly as jewellery and tola bars"}},"institutions":{"centralBank":{"name":"State Bank of Pakistan","url":"https://www.sbp.org.pk/"},"insuranceRegulator":{"name":"Securities and Exchange Commission of Pakistan","url":"https://www.secp.gov.pk/"},"insuranceComplaints":{"name":"Federal Insurance Ombudsman","url":"https://fio.gov.pk/submit-ticket.html"},"pensionScheme":{"name":"Employees'' Old-Age Benefits Institution","url":"http://www.eobi.gov.pk/introduction/Pension.html","note":"Site serves over http only"},"oldAgeAllowance":null,"publicHealthCover":{"name":"Ministry of National Health Services, Regulations and Coordination (Sehat Sahulat Programme)","url":"https://www.nhsrc.gov.pk/","note":"The Sehat Sahulat Programme site (pmhealthprogram.gov.pk) was unreachable"},"depositInsurance":{"name":"Deposit Protection Corporation","url":"https://www.dpc.org.pk/"},"statistics":{"name":"Pakistan Bureau of Statistics","url":"https://www.pbs.gov.pk/"}},"researchedAt":"2026-10-31","reviewedBy":"research-workflow"}');
